      "originalText": "Real tests, lint, types, build and approved security scanners run first.\nThen: Claude reviewer + Codex reviewer + load-balanced arbiter.\nCOMPLETE = gates pass + 2/3 approve + zero blockers + evidence.\n\nAmbiguity \u2192 Analyst/Product \u2022 architecture \u2192 Architect/Security\ncode \u2192 Code Writer \u2022 tests \u2192 QA \u2022 delivery \u2192 DevOps",
